[[Charr Prison Guard (boss)|Charr Prison Guard]]s are [[Charr]] [[boss]]es encountered during [[Warband of Brothers]] that must be killed to proceed.

==Missions==
*[[Depths of Tyria]]
**{{NPC location|Warband of Brothers}}

==Skills==
* {{skill icon|Bull's Strike}}
* {{skill icon|Executioner's Strike}}
* {{skill icon|Eviscerate}} ([[elite]])
* {{skill icon|Flail}}
* {{skill icon|Frenzy}}
* {{skill icon|Lion's Comfort}}
* {{monster skill icon|Infernal Rage}}

==Items dropped==
* [[Charr Armor]]
* [[Charr Garment]]
* [[Prison Key]] (always)
* [[Superb Charr Carving]]

==Notes==
* In Normal Mode, they will often cancel [[Infernal Rage]] with their other stances even though it is superior to both.

{{anomaly|They will [[drop]] a Prison Key after dying. If [[resurrect|resurrected]] by a [[Charr Dominator]] and killed again, another key will drop.}}
